#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"For B<mkstemp>()  and B<mkostemp>(): The last six characters of I<template> "
"were not XXXXXX; now I<template> is unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Pentru B<mkstemp>() și B<mkostemp>(): ultimele șase caractere din I<șablon> "
"nu erau XXXXXX; acum I<șablon> este neschimbat."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"For B<mkstemps>()  and B<mkostemps>(): I<template> is less than I<(6 + "
"suffixlen)> characters long, or the last 6 characters before the suffix in "
"I<template> were not XXXXXX."
msgstr ""
"Pentru B<mkstemps>() și B<mkostemps>(): I<șablon> are mai puțin de I<(6 + "
"suffixlen)> caractere sau ultimele 6 caractere dinaintea sufixului din "
"I<șablon> nu au fost XXXXXX."

#. type: Plain text
#: archlinux debian-bookworm debian-unstable fedora-41 fedora-rawhide
#: mageia-cauldron opensuse-leap-16-0 opensuse-tumbleweed
msgid ""
"These functions may also fail with any of the errors described for "
"B<open>(2)."
msgstr ""
"Aceste funcții pot eșua, de asemenea, cu oricare dintre erorile descrise "
"pentru B<open>(2)."

